  "id": "cauliflower-potato-style-salad",
  "name": "Cauliflower Potato-Style Salad",
  "subtitle": "A crisp cauliflower salad with creamy dressing and bacon",
  "description": "Blanched cauliflower, eggs, celery, pickles, and bacon come together in a tangy mayonnaise dressing.",
